    {
      "id": "grounded-memo-drafting",
      "name": "AI-drafted risk assessment memo with citations",
      "story": "As a reviewer, I open a ready, scored case and the Risk Assessment Memo Assistant drafts a memo grounded only in the versioned policy corpus and that case's record — covering beneficial ownership, jurisdiction exposure, sanctions results and the computed score — carrying a permanent MACHINE-DRAFTED label and citations I can trace to the cited policy provision, and every redraft is kept as a new immutable version rather than overwriting the last. The agent is advisory only: its roster grants it no tool to change status, score, or record an approval.",
