    {
      "id": "tiered-approval-rbac",
      "name": "Role-based tiered approval and rejection",
      "story": "As a named approver, I approve or reject a case only at the tier my role permits — analyst for Low, senior analyst for Medium, compliance officer with a documented rationale for High — and the decision is recorded with my identity, the role I held at decision time and the tier required, adopting the memo text as approved; a rejection captures its reason and notifies the client relationship team, auditors can change nothing, and the UI disables an approval I am not entitled to give with the reason why. Seeded named users ana.patel (kyc_analyst), sam.reyes (senior_analyst), priya.osei (compliance_officer) and dan.wu (auditor) provide one account per role.",
